              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeroboam ŋolo a ŋiarei totwana, tonukae neni anukitae ŋirwosi a Isirael. Kilunyokin Sakariya ŋolo arae lokoku keŋ lokicoloŋ keŋ, kipuka Ŋisirael.",
          "type": "text",
